{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_16_level_main_16-05_beg",
  "groupId": "main_16",
  "stageId": "main_16-04",
  "title": "分水岭线",
  "storyCode": "16-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "292e732a76cea5cb17a898a24e3754f8b85b900a6aedb184ffc3de3b8105101b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>乌萨斯，远北中心矿区研究所</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
      "text": "她刚刚......是不是说了“内卫”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我听到她说的是......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "杀死内卫。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "她的意思是......这种叫“奥卡”的物质，杀死了内卫？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "这可能吗？难道这是某种比“国度”更恐怖的邪魔产物？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "一种从矿井中发现的未知物质。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "研究所用它分别在感染者和非感染者身上做了实验。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "实验结果显示，它会使感染者的病情加重。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "也许，这是这里的研究员对某种物质的特殊称呼，在见到实物之前，我们都没法下定论。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "科谢尼娅，科谢尼娅！看着我，你还能想起些什么吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "我......你是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Mon3tr以为这次呼唤会与之前一样毫无收获，但女人迷蒙的双眼却忽地睁大了。\n紧接着，她反手死死抓住眼前人的衣服，把Mon3tr拽到身前。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "你是——您是所长？凯尔希所长？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "是您来接我了吗？我想回去，我还想见到老师——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "我想见伊利亚老师......还有柳达......呜......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "但他们......他们还会想见我吗？我这样懦弱，什么也做不到......我还配见到他们吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "呜......呜呜——啊！！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "我......我——"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "然而没等Mon3tr作出回应，女人又兀自放手，跌坐回去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "不，不对......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "你不是凯尔希所长。我再也没见到过她，就像我再也没见到过其他人。她不该在这里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "我甚至见过她后来的同伴，他们......他们......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "你见过？你见过谁？是不是一位个子小小的、总是面带微笑的黎博利？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "黎博利......是啊，我见过她。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "她去哪儿了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "我不知道......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "那群杀死内卫的人......那些感染者，她之前和那些人在一起。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "他们会死！所有人都会死！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "科谢尼娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_4208_wintim_1",
          "text": "呜......我不知道——我不知道......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "她需要镇静剂。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她有脱水症状。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "那这些信息——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "矿工出逃与内卫有关。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Mantra说过内卫造成的污染在向南蔓延。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "答案已经很明显了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "可是，内卫真的被杀了吗？被一群矿工？这有可能吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "或许我们应该考虑......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "如果这是真的，那将意味着什么。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "那位女大公封锁矿区的真正目的，是为了隐藏有个内卫死在了她的辖区的事实？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "但这不可能！无论是皇帝还是集团军，都不会善罢甘休的，如果她真的想要掩盖这件事，一开始就不会答应让我们进入矿区。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "还有那位近卫军，她知道这件事吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "没错......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这些正是我们需要担心的事。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "先通知Mantra和阿米娅吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
          "text": "收到，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
          "text": "我们这里同样有些发现，与你们得到的情报相符。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
          "text": "有打斗痕迹的场所，遗落了一些医疗用品。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
          "text": "是罗德岛的制式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
          "text": "我们马上与你们会合。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "明白......博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "我们马上就到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "怎么了？你的同伴那边有什么发现？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "恐怕需要我们会合后才能说明。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "阿洛伊泽小姐，这里还有什么需要注意的线索吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "我所知有限，得不出什么更有效的信息，有必要的话，一会让那位博士亲自来查看一下也无妨。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "不过这倒是更加让我确信了军方毫无底线这件事......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "阿洛伊泽小姐，我想问，对于发生在矿区的事，您还知道什么吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "嗯？你是想问什么？这座研究所里的实验还是发生变异的感染者？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "......怎么了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "阿米娅向来抗拒在这样的情况下，以这种方式使用自己的能力，但她仍旧尝试着去触碰了眼前这位近卫军的思绪。\n阿洛伊泽的心头满是阴霾和疑惑，却并未掺杂心虚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "没什么，我们走吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "博士，这些资料......还有遗书，该怎么办？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这份遗书没有提及太多与石棺有关的内容。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "那位近卫军提供了不少情报，我们也该适当地回报。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "靠近的声音",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "是在这边吗？还真是难找......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "靠近的声音",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "果然，藏得这么深，一定有秘密——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "——等等，这是谁？"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "近卫军的目光投向斜靠在墙边，面色苍白，双目紧闭的女人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "一个没有撤离的研究员，科谢尼娅。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "研究所与流动医疗队可能有往来，我们想问她我们那些同伴的去向，但她精神恍惚，脱水严重，不宜继续接受询问。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "那地上这些蜡烛和线路又是......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "......我猜，这是她为自我了断所做的准备。博士，这里到底发生了什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们及时赶到，阻止了爆炸发生。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "情况很复杂。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "你手上拿着的那些文件是什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "遗书，你也看看吧。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "（递给她）",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "......一事无成的研究员，名叫“奥卡”的神秘物质......人体实验。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "看上去，我们在下面见到的那些死者，是被这个“奥卡”杀死的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "这里真的在做人体实验？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerId": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "该死，我当时只是一说——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
          "text": "（摇头）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "哼，看来女大公果真隐瞒了很多东西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "但是这个实验的目的是什么？这里的研究员会使用这种卑劣的手段，我并不意外，但他们总该有所图才是！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "这位研究员本人呢？她什么也没说吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "看上去有些研究资料已经被人为销毁了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "但不确定是矿工还是这里的研究员自己所为。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "所以，我们还是不知道那些变异感染者诞生的原因。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "不过，起码现在我们知道这里还有活下来的矿工逃走了，除开这位研究员，那些逃走的矿工很可能就是整件事的唯一切入点了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那些感染者矿工在洗劫了研究所后离开了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "他们往南去了，这是唯一的线索。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "我们该抓紧时间了......这位研究员恢复到可以接受询问的状态还需要多久？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": "avg_4179_monstr_1",
          "text": "很难预估。她脱水严重，刚见面时精神状况也很糟糕，我们得先为她治疗。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "真麻烦......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "我们还不清楚矿工已经出逃了多久，既然知道了方向，就必须抓紧时间追上去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "可我们不可能带着没有行动能力的伤员上路。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我和Mon3tr留下看顾科谢尼娅。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你们去追踪离开的矿工队伍。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "呃......你们确定要单独留在这里？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "虽然这是你们的自由，但我还是有必要提醒你们。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "现在没人知道远北这些矿区都处于什么样的状态，同样也没人能保障你们的安全。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们有能力保护好自己的安全。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你们可以相信阿米娅的指挥。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "博士？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你可以的，阿米娅。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "相信你自己的判断。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
          "text": "我会和阿米娅一起。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
          "text": "博士，希望你们顺利。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "等科谢尼娅恢复行动能力，我们就去找你们会合。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "离开污染区之后，通讯应该会逐渐恢复。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "那就这样。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerId": "avg_1037_amiya3_1",
          "text": "博士，如果通讯一直没有恢复，那我们找到那群矿工之后就回研究所和你们会合。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "speakerId": "avg_4204_mantra_1",
          "text": "（点头）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿洛伊泽",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1966_1",
          "text": "行，后备计划也有了，我们赶紧出发。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "<p=1>乌萨斯远北中心矿区</><p=2>三天前</>"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "就在这边......快过来！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "疑惑的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "哎，你跑什么！这破定位时灵时不灵的，指不定根本就不在这儿。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "疑惑的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "上次有个矿场的驮兽为了找草吃跑出了界，愣是让它跑了十多里路这东西才往岗哨发送信号，谁知道这次是不是也是一样的情况？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "散漫的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "按理说这些人不该出现在南出口周围，这条路早就封了——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "疑惑的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "嗯？你怎么会从那边过来？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "疑惑的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "不对，你不是我们队的吧，你在这儿做什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "散漫的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "我还想问你呢。这儿不在你们队的管辖范围内吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "疑惑的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "现在早就不兴那套辖区不辖区的东西了，谁先接到消息，先找到逃跑的感染者，那功劳就是谁的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "疑惑的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "让开，别挡道。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "散漫的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "照你的说法，是我们先来的，那这功劳理应是我们的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "疑惑的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "谁找到就*乌萨斯粗口*算谁的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "纠察队队长",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "托夏，干什么呢？别跟他废话，找人要紧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "在这边！他们都躲在——哈哈哈哈啊哈哈！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "疑惑的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "他发现什么了笑成这样？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "纠察队队长",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "走，去看看。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "前面有个不深不浅的洞，那几个矿工就躲在里面，还以为我们发现不了——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "天哪，哈哈哈哈哈啊哈哈......这太好笑了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "纠察队队长",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "哼。他们以为那是什么，战壕吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "纠察队队长",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "托夏，戈沙，带上所有人，你们赶紧去把那些驮兽不如的蠢货给我弄出来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "散漫的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "从定位上看，这些逃窜的感染者矿工数量还不少呢，需要帮忙吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "纠察队队长",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "你们队有多少人？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "散漫的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "不多，算上我也就六个人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "纠察队队长",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "太多了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "散漫的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "随你怎么说。咱们是这附近仅剩的两支空闲队伍，而且是我们先到的这里。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "散漫的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "这碗羹，你们不分也得分。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "纠察队队长",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "散漫的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "怎么——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——啊！！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "尖叫声打破了两支队伍的对峙。\n紧随其后的，是肢体搏斗、钝器砸碎骨肉的声响。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "纠察队队长",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_082",
          "text": "发生什么——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "救命！救我！他们都疯了——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "激动的纠察队队员",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "这些该死的感染者都*乌萨斯粗口*疯了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雷尔金",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
          "text": "你说得对......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雷尔金",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_1963_1",
          "text": "我会让你们见识一下，感染者的愤怒，还有疯狂。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
